# Dynamic map insertion performance

Measures insertion of new integer keys into one dynamic map. The workload
grows the hash index and insertion-order storage, then reads the final entry.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let values = {}

for (iteration in 0..25000) {
    values[iteration] = iteration + 1
}

print(values[24999])
